								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3011.msg34566#msg34566">Re: Now Bush can Take all your Stuff</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> August 02, 2007, 02:59:30 pm &#187;</div></td>
