							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Does this include people/artist who speak out against the war, and sell CD&#039;s?<br /><br />Isn&#039;t that an ammedment violation?</div>
						</td>
