									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3011.msg34677#msg34677">Re: Now Bush can Take all your Stuff</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #5 on:</b> August 03, 2007, 04:18:05 pm &#187;</div></td>
